  /* Brand — the symbol beside the product wordmark, one lockup.
     The institute logotype is gone (Andy, 2026-08-13); the product name is
     the logotype here, and it is "Biochar Atlas" (Andy, 2026-08-14, reversing
     the "Atlas" alone shipped the day before). Side by side rather than
     stacked for two reasons. The
     header has ~72px of vertical room and Crimson Pro at display scale is a
     wide, low word, so stacking would push the first nav row down the rail.
     And laid out horizontally the collapse is honest — the word drops away
     and the symbol stays exactly where it was, rather than the pair
     reflowing. The institute keeps its credit in the img alt. */
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-250, 0.625rem);
    padding: var(--spacing-200, 0.5rem);
